<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Country Heights stock suspended.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Country Heights stock suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock of Malaysia's Country Heights Holdings Bhd were suspended in late-morning trading, the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>The stock was last traded at 17.90 ringgit, up 1.60 on volume of 603,000 shares.</p>
<p>No reason was given for the suspension of the property development firm and a company official contacted by Reuters declined to comment.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
